  "title": "SB 143 (2024 Regular Session): AN ACT proposing to amend Sections 145 and 155 of the Constitution of Kentucky relating to persons entitled to vote.",
  "urls": [
    "https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/record/24RS/sb143.html",
